# Build context for devops/docker/Dockerfile: Cargo manifests, .cargo/, crates/, proto/,
# plus what the chaos image ships at runtime (configs/, scenarios/, stress/, topologies/, the built UI).
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!.cargo/
!crates/
# The project's migrations, embedded at compile time by `sqlx::migrate!` in
# crates/db. Without this the build fails inside the image with
# "error canonicalizing migration directory", which reads like a path bug
# rather than a missing build context.
!migrations/
!proto/
!configs/
!scenarios/
!stress/
!topologies/
!ui/chaos/out/
# never ship build output or secrets even if the allowlist above matches a subpath
**/target/
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
# The sign-in UI (Dockerfile.auth-ui builds it from source; never its outputs).
!ui/auth/
ui/auth/node_modules/
ui/auth/.next/
# The company site (Dockerfile.www builds it from source; never its outputs).
!ui/www/
ui/www/node_modules/
ui/www/.next/
ui/www/out/
!devops/docker/www.Caddyfile
